_replica / replica flag=false&lt;br&gt;region=null / read 100 / write 100 / no runtime failover proof" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="1620.00" y="820.00" width="1250.00" height="140.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n67" value="Optional topic / create_alert_topic=true: no alarm or subscription declared.&lt;br&gt;IAM policy / statements=[]: home provider, tenancy fallback.&lt;br&gt;Two terraform_data contracts hold metadata, not deployed services.&lt;br&gt;No app/SDK, private endpoint or table-to-subnet binding is declared." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="60.00" y="1020.00" width="2800.00" height="85.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n68" value="DEFAULT RESULT: Seven OCI instances by source defaults: five network resources, one table and one topic; two local metadata contracts also exist.&lt;br&gt;Ten OCI declarations plus two local contract declarations include the disabled index, replica and policy branches. Default settings can incur charges if applied.&lt;br&gt;The application network is separate from regional NoSQL; no SDK client, service access path, IAM grant, object data or working Internet path is inferred.&lt;br&gt;Only this documentation was generated. No table creation, read/write, replica consistency, failover, billing or notification test was run." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1360.00" width="2940.00" height="160.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n69" value="Source and rendered-diagram review: 2026-10-28. Historical Terraform/provider validation metadata is unchanged.&lt;br&gt;No provisioning, image build/pull, invocation, event delivery, application traffic or cloud test was run." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1570.00" width="2940.00" height="60.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="route_table_id" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.2338709677;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="security_list_ids" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.7419354839;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n54" value="Configured default route" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n64" value="table_name_or_id / index binding" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A